<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<title>Developer Zone Premier Account Approved</title>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	
</head>


<body style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: none;background-color: #f9f9f9;background: url(https://tstcqcontent-ssl.cps.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/gradiantbg-body.png) repeat-x scroll left top #f9f9f9;height: 100%;outline: medium none;font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-weight: normal;font-size: 10pt;color: #666666;">
<div id="container" style="width: 600px;margin-top: 10px;margin-right: auto;margin-bottom: 10px;margin-left: auto;position: relative;background-color: #FFFFFF;border-color: #E5E5E5;border-style: solid;padding: 25px 50px 0px 50px;border-width: 1px;overflow: hidden;line-height: 1.5em;"><header style="display: block;font-family: &quot;Intel Clear Pro&quot;, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-weight: normal;font-size: 1.1em;color: #003C71;line-height: 2em;">
<h1><img src="https://messagecenter-cons.intel.com/v1/images/uploads/5104bda0-0fc2-11ec-901e-3750230d5760.png" alt="" title="devzone-premier-header_720x160@2x.png" width="700" height="156"></h1>
<hr style="background-color: #E5E5E5;color: #E5E5E5;border: 0 none;height: 1px;"><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><!-- horizontal line --></span></header><main style="display: block;">
</main><p class="subjectTextStyle" style="font-size: 1.2em;font-weight: bold;color: #086DB6;line-height: 1.4em;"><span face="intel clear, sans-serif" style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;">Welcome to Developer Zone Premier</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">Welcome {!Contact.Name},</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">Your request for a Developer Zone Premier account is approved and includes the following benefits: 
<p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">
Secure access to pre-release software
</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">
Secure access to pre-release specifications, documentation, and roadmaps
</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">
Secure access to custom training and certification
</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">
Hardware testing support
</span></li>
</ol></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">
Visit the  <a href="http://www.intel.com/apps/intel/services/unifiedlogin.html?tgt=https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/resources-documentation/developer.html" style="color: #086DB6;">Developer Zone</a> to get started and Manage  your profile, including available marketing subscriptions via <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/my-intel/profile.html" class="external-link" rel="nofollow" style="color: #086DB6;">My Intel</a> </span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">Additionally, as part of your Intel Developer Zone account, you now have access to exclusive Intel Partner Alliance resources – including <a href="https://partneruniversity.intel.com/learn" style="color: #086DB6;">Intel Partner University</a>, <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/partner-alliance/zones/overview.html" style="color: #086DB6;">Partner Enablement Zones</a> and more. If you prefer not to access Intel® Partner University, Enablement Zones, and other partner resources, you may <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/support/articles/000095301/programs/intel-partner-alliance.html" style="color: #086DB6;">opt out</a> of these Intel Partner Alliance benefits at any time.</span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">As a reminder, you are obligated to treat Intel’s Confidential Information carefully by either the confidentiality obligations contained in Section 4 of the <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/partner-alliance/legal/program-terms-and-conditions.html." class="external-link" rel="nofollow" style="color: #086DB6;">Intel® Partner Alliance Terms and Conditions</a>  or by the active CNDA in place between your Company and Intel. Please be aware that you must uphold those obligations as a recipient of Developer Zone Premier access. </span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">To ensure uninterrupted access to your account, Intel recommends having at least 2 multi-factor authentication methods. You can add an additional method by visiting the <a href="https://mysignins.microsoft.com/security-info?tenant=intel.com" class="external-link" rel="nofollow" style="color: #086DB6;">Intel Azure Security Information </a> page and select “Add sign-in method.”  For further information please visit our FAQ for </span> <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/support/topics/azure-sign-in-faq.html" class="external-link" rel="nofollow" style="color: #086DB6;">adding additional authentication methods </a> </p>

<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">Please retain this email for future reference and note that Premier access is associated with this email address {!Contact.Email} only.</span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">If you have any questions, please contact <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/support/contact-intel.html#support-intel-programs" class="external-link" rel="nofollow" style="color: #086DB6;">Intel® Customer Support</a>.</span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">Sincerely,</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">Developer Zone Registration Administrator</span></p>
<main style="display: block;">
</main><p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail message. This is an automated response. To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, add us to your address book.</span></p>

<section style="display: block;font-size: 0.8em;font-style: italic;color: black;line-height: 1.4em;">
</section><p style="text-align: right;"></p>

